### Hotel Booking Prototype API — contoh pemanggilan (VS 2022: buka tab .http, klik "Send Request")
### Base URL: http://localhost:5210

### 1. Registrasi (OTP dikirim ke console/log)
POST http://localhost:5210/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Budi Santoso",
  "phoneNumber": "081234567890"
}

### 2. Verifikasi OTP (ambil OTP dari console aplikasi)
POST http://localhost:5210/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "otpCode": "123456"
}

### 3. Login (akun demo: customer@demo.com / Demo1234!)
POST http://localhost:5210/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrPhone": "customer@demo.com",
  "password": "Demo1234!"
}

### 4. Cari hotel
GET http://localhost:5210/api/v1/hotels/search?destination=Jakarta&checkIn=2026-12-01&checkOut=2026-12-03&guestCount=2

### 5. Buat booking (ganti {{token}} dengan access_token dari login)
POST http://localhost:5210/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": "HTL-JKT-001",
  "roomId": "RM-JKT-STD",
  "guestName": "Budi Santoso",
  "checkIn": "2026-12-01",
  "checkOut": "2026-12-03",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### 6. Buat pembayaran (ganti bookingId)
POST http://localhost:5210/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "method": "VA"
}

### 7. Simulasikan callback sukses dari Payment Gateway (ganti paymentId)
POST http://localhost:5210/api/v1/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/simulate-callback?status=SUCCESS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Riwayat booking
GET http://localhost:5210/api/v1/bookings/history?group=inprogress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Preview pembatalan (ganti bookingId)
GET http://localhost:5210/api/v1/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancellation-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Batalkan booking (ganti bookingId)
POST http://localhost:5210/api/v1/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Berubah rencana" }

### 11. Approval refund oleh Finance (login finance@demo.com / Demo1234!)
POST http://localhost:5210/api/v1/refunds/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}

### 12. Eksekusi refund
POST http://localhost:5210/api/v1/refunds/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}

### 13. Verifikasi QR E-Ticket (code dari response callback / console)
GET http://localhost:5210/api/v1/etickets/verify?code=BOOKINGNUMBER.token
